---
// A gold rope between two brass posts: pure decoration for the velvet room (spec FR-003). It is
// hidden from assistive technology, holds no text, ignores the pointer and takes no focus.
// The rope is an SVG that stretches to whatever width its card or figure has; non-scaling strokes
// keep its thickness. The posts are drawn in CSS, so they are never stretched. See gallery.css.
---

<span class="cordon" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="post post-left"></span>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 100 40" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path class="rope-under" d="M 0 4 Q 50 44 100 4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></path>
    <path class="rope" d="M 0 4 Q 50 44 100 4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></path>
    <path class="rope-twist" d="M 0 4 Q 50 44 100 4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></path>
  </svg>
  <span class="post post-right"></span>
</span>
